TY  - JOUR
TI  - Hashtivismo desinformativo: el negacionismo de la dictadura argentina en Instagram
AU  - Tarullo, Raquel
AU  - Frezzotti, Yanina
T2  - Comunicación y medios
AB  - Abstract: This article studies the hoaxes that accompany the denialist hashtags #nofueron30000 and #nofueron30mil in Argentina. A quantitative content analysis of 223 disinformative posts published on Instagram from February 6, 2020, to February 6, 2022 was carried out, complementing the examination using a qualitative technique on the most popular posts (n=52). The results show that misleading visual content about historical memory is not the one that receives the most interaction. As a strategy of disinformation, hyperpartisan manipulation is used and videos and “memes” are exploited for ridiculing its critics, with a high level of incivility that contributes to polarization. Finally, they appropriate hashtags from opposition movements to produce disinformation narratives.
